    "fr": "PPP — Propriétés Perceptuelles Pertinentes",
    "en": "PPP — Relevant Perceptual Properties"
   },
   "dct:description": [
    {
     "@value": "Vocabulaire SKOS des types publiés de PPP (fiches publiques), de leurs régions, échelles et familles de lecture. Les fiches YAML du dépôt sont la source ; cet export s’en déduit.",
     "@language": "fr"
    },
    {
     "@value": "SKOS vocabulary of the published PPP types (public entries), their regions, scales and reading families. The YAML entries of the repository are the source; this export is derived from them.",
     "@language": "en"
    }
   ],
   "dct_license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
