  {
   "@id": "https://w3id.org/ppp/perceptualContrast/mesure/peli1990",
   "@type": "ppp:AssociatedMeasure",
   "rdfs_label": {
    "fr": "contraste de luminance",
    "en": "luminance contrast"
   },
   "quantity": {
    "fr": "contraste de luminance, calculé à partir des luminances de deux plages ou, localement, sur une image",
    "en": "luminance contrast, computed from the luminances of two patches or, locally, on an image"
   },
   "unitOrScale": {
    "fr": "nombre sans dimension",
    "en": "dimensionless number"
   },
   "gap": {
    "fr": "ne vaut que pour la dimension de la clarté, alors que ce type compare une qualité choisie ; porte sur la luminance, pas sur la différence perçue ; en accord avec le contraste perçu pour des images simples (réseau, plage sur fond uniforme), pas pour des images complexes ; ne saisit ni l’observateur, ni l’entourage, ni la distance",
    "en": "valid only for the lightness dimension, whereas this type compares a chosen quality; concerns luminance, not the perceived difference; in agreement with perceived contrast for simple images (grating, patch on a uniform background), not for complex images; it captures neither the observer, nor the surround, nor the distance"
   },
   "measurementConditions": {
    "fr": "luminances mesurées (luminancemètre ou image calibrée) ; image simple ; dimension comparée : la clarté",
    "en": "measured luminances (luminance meter or calibrated image); simple image; dimension compared: lightness"
   },
   "proximity": "https://w3id.org/ppp/mesure/proximite/indirecte",
   "dct:bibliographicCitation": "Peli, E. (1990). Contrast in complex images. Journal of the Optical Society of America A, 7(10), 2032–2040."
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://w3id.org/ppp/perceptualContrast/echelle",
   "@type": "skos:OrderedCollection",
