   },
   "example": {
    "fr": "reliefs individuels visibles et palpables (une pierre brute éclatée, une écorce)",
    "en": "individual reliefs that can be seen and felt (a split, unworked stone, a tree bark)"
   },
   "regionOf": "https://w3id.org/ppp/texture",
   "broader": "https://w3id.org/ppp/texture"
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://w3id.org/ppp/textureDirectionality/mesure/iso_25178_2",
   "@type": "ppp:AssociatedMeasure",
   "rdfs_label": {
    "fr": "rapport d’aspect et direction de la texture (Str, Std)",
    "en": "texture aspect ratio and texture direction (Str, Std)"
   },
   "quantity": {
    "fr": "rapport entre la plus courte et la plus longue distance sur laquelle le relief cesse de se ressembler à lui-même, selon la direction (Str, de 0 à 1) ; direction dominante du relief (Std)",
    "en": "ratio of the shortest to the longest distance over which the relief stops resembling itself, depending on direction (Str, 0 to 1); dominant direction of the relief (Std)"
   },
   "unitOrScale": {
    "fr": "Str entre 0 et 1, sans dimension ; Std, angle en degrés",
    "en": "Str between 0 and 1, dimensionless; Std, angle in degrees"
   },
   "gap": {
    "fr": "calculés sur une petite surface relevée, à une échelle souvent plus fine que celle qu’on voit ou qu’on sent ; ne saisissent ni la distance de vue, ni l’éclairage (une lumière rasante dans le sens des stries les fait ressortir ou disparaître), ni l’observateur, ni, au toucher, le sens du geste",
    "en": "computed on a small measured area, at a scale often finer than what is seen or felt; they capture neither the viewing distance, nor the lighting (raking light along the grooves brings them out or makes them disappear), nor the observer, nor, by touch, the direction of the hand movement"
   },
   "measurementConditions": {
    "fr": "surface relevée par un instrument surfacique ; zone d’évaluation et filtres fixés par l’opérateur et la norme",
    "en": "area measured by an areal instrument; evaluation area and filters set by the operator and the standard"
   },
   "proximity": "https://w3id.org/ppp/mesure/proximite/proche",
   "dct:bibliographicCitation": [
    "ISO 25178-2:2021. Geometrical product specifications (GPS) — Surface texture: Areal — Part 2: Terms, definitions and surface texture parameters. Genève : ISO.",
    "Petzing, J., Coupland, J. & Leach, R. K. (2010). The Measurement of Rough Surface Topography using Coherence Scanning Interferometry. Measurement Good Practice Guide No. 116. Teddington : National Physical Laboratory."
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "https://w3id.org/ppp/textureDirectionality/echelle",
   "@type": "skos:OrderedCollection",
   "prefLabel": {
    "fr": "échelle de « orientation de la texture »",
